expression: "query(Company::query().shared_lock())"
---
PostgreSQL: SELECT "companies"."id", "companies"."name", "companies"."country" FROM "companies" FOR SHARE
MySQL: SELECT `companies`.`id`, `companies`.`name`, `companies`.`country` FROM `companies` LOCK IN SHARE MODE
SQLite: SELECT "companies"."id", "companies"."name", "companies"."country" FROM "companies"
